                <pb facs="0591" n="507" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg507"/>

                <head>No. 254.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Messrs. Cushing and McKenney to Mr.
                        Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Portland, Me.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-07-03"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 3, 1886</date>.
                        [Received July—.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Our schooner City Point seized in Shelburne, Nova Scotia, for taking in water and
                    allowing men ashore before reporting. Please give instructions.</p>
                <closer><signed>CUSHING &amp; McKENNEY.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
